  "solution": "**Logic :** (1st number + 3rd number) = (2nd number ÷ 4)\n\n**Given :**\n\n \n• (25, 280, 45)\n\n25 + 45 = 280 ÷ 4\n\n70 = 70 (LHS = RHS)\n\n \n• (18, 192, 30)\n\n18 + 30 = 192 ÷ 4\n\n48 = 48 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n \n• Option - (1) : (12, 156, 24)\n\n12 + 24 = 156 ÷ 4\n\n36 ≠ 39 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (2) : (14, 192, 24)\n\n14 + 24 = 192 ÷ 4\n\n38 ≠ 39 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (3) : (12, 148, 25)\n\n12 + 25 = 148 ÷ 4\n\n**37 = 37 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n \n• Option - (4) : (13, 168, 54)\n\n13 + 54 = 168 ÷ 4\n\n67 ≠ 42 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, **\"Option - (3)\"** is the correct answer.",
